{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260707-YIK_8770-1024x799.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260707-YIK_8800-1024x769.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260707-YIK_8817-1024x778.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260707-YIK_9044-1024x738.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A0892-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>天文台昨日凌晨發出雷暴警告，有效時間延長至今日上午11時30分，預料香港有幾陣強烈狂風雷暴。</p>\n<p>天文台上午8時23分更新新界北部水浸特別報告，新界北部尤其八鄉及錦田、上水、打鼓嶺一帶正受大雨影響。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/0N5A0896-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>1 月 至今暴雨警告時數 較去多 7.7 倍</p>\n<p>翻查紀錄，天文台今年已發出 39 個黃雨警告、11 個紅雨及 3 個黑雨警告，總時數達 116小時 44 分鐘，時數較只曾發出 8 個黃雨警告的去年同期多出 逾 7.7 倍。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rain-819x1024.jpg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-08T02:58:26.531909+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":8,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}